    narr:narration """This narrative hub maintains its core [anti-Slack positioning](narr:Position_AntiPatternRealtimeChat) by framing the product as a [structured async decision platform](narr:Position_ProductCategoryAsyncPlatform). The project remains anchored to its initial [target market of remote teams](narr:Position_TargetMarketRemoteTeams), though the monetization model has evolved from the [original $12 flat pricing](narr:Position_PricingTwelveDollars) to a tiered structure that accounts for team scale. Since the last review, the narrative has shifted from purely conceptual category-building toward tangible execution, marked by the [delivery of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786268099549_1). This transition suggests a move toward validating the platform's utility within the defined ICP, moving the project from a theoretical opposition to real-time chat into a functional, shipping reality.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786268099549_1> ;
